  "description_uk": "Тримає ротик на золотому замочку, злегка нахиляє голівку й показує ключ тією самою лапкою. Інша лапка тихенько вказує на застібку: таємницю збереже.",
  "semantics": {
    "core_scene": "Single gold zipped mouth with pull, one key held by same paw, other single pointing hand, calm wide eyes and assuring head tilt.",
    "omitted_optional_action": "Handoff, extra ear-side hand and synthetic blink omitted; zipper never opens and key never changes hands.",
    "reversibility_or_contact": "Both zipper ends and pull follow the same head map; key ring/shaft/bit share wrist rotation with held paw. Pointing finger has a separate2px gesture, feet remain grounded."
  },
